# 💼 Hustle Goal Tracker

> Set an income goal, commit to a timeframe, track your progress, and turn your side hustle into measurable momentum.

# 📌 Overview

Hustle Goal Tracker is a goal-tracking application built for people working on a side hustle, freelance work, small business, or other income-generating projects.

Instead of simply setting a goal and forgetting about it, the application turns an income target into something measurable. Users can define how much they want to earn, choose a timeframe, record their progress, and use visual insights to understand how they are performing.

The project combines **goal tracking, progress visualization, and light gamification** to make working toward financial goals more engaging and motivating.


# ✨ Features

- 🎯 Set custom income goals
- 📅 Define a target timeframe
- 💰 Track progress toward financial targets
- 📊 Visualize goal and progress data
- 📈 View insights related to performance
- 🎮 Gamified elements to make progress more engaging
- 📱 Responsive user interface
- 🔄 Track progress over time

> Features listed above should reflect the functionality currently available in the application.


# 🔄 How It Works

The basic workflow is:

```text
Set a Goal
    ↓
Choose a Target & Timeframe
    ↓
Work on Your Hustle
    ↓
Record Your Progress
    ↓
Track Performance
    ↓
Use Insights to Stay on Course


